insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('6d3c84c1-bc4c-5401-abf2-948aeb83ef32', 'wg8-argument-writing-p05', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g8-argument-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Save the Old Depot$q$, $q$(1) The brick train depot on Mill Road has stood empty since the last passenger train left Harlow in 1962. (2) The town council should restore the depot and open it as a local history museum. (3) The building itself is a piece of history. (4) It was built in 1898, and records at the town library show that it once handled shipments of grain, lumber, and mail for the entire county. (5) A museum would also give students a place to learn about Harlow's past. (6) Right now, the closest history museum is forty miles away, so few classes can visit.

(7) Some residents believe the town should tear the depot down and build a parking lot. (8) More parking would help shoppers downtown. (9) Yet a museum could draw visitors who would also shop and eat downtown. (10) The nearby town of Corwin restored its old mill as a museum, and its downtown businesses reported more customers the following year.

(11) Old things are cool. (12) The depot connects Harlow to its past, and with care it can connect Harlow to its future as well.$q$, 'draft')
