   $q$Which sentence is least relevant to the writer's argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (7)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (11)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (10)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-reason"},{"text":"sentence (4)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (11)$q$, $q$Sentence (11) is a personal memory about a butterfly at the beach and gives no reason for planting a native garden at school. Sentence (10) adds a real benefit, an outdoor classroom, so it should stay in the essay.$q$, 'draft', '4c9242a6-9423-5b80-bd3b-b16f6c491320')
